  <!-- design §2.2: "requiresAnyMeme none; requiresHostile to Empire" - wired
       wave 2 (GRAFFITI_PUNK_IDEOLIGION_SCOPE_1) via
       ModExtension_Graffiti.requiresHostileToFactionDef +
       GraffitiPool.HostilityGateAllows: on a mod list carrying Royalty's
       vanilla `Empire` FactionDef with an actual Faction instance in the
       game, only a placer whose own faction is HostileTo the Empire is
       offered this mark. On any other mod list (no Royalty, or Royalty
       active but no Empire spawned this game) the gate opens - the crown
       stays available exactly as wave 1 shipped it. Owner ruling
       2026-09-24: FEATURE, ship as-is; the anti-Imperial reading is
       intentional (see this item's RSW Aurebesh/cog variant, and note the
       campaign's own Galactic Empire IS this same vanilla Empire faction,
       reskinned - galactic-empire-is-reskinned-vanilla). -->
